      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-1472\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">8.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"1472\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"279\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c21D4\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D446 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2261\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⇔</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>≡</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sun, Oct 11th @ 5:34 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:15</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
