    {
      "dom_id": "question-182523",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "$¬(Y⇔X)≡$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we use the definition of the biconditional statement to write the equivalence as a conjunction of implications: \n\n$$\n¬(Y⇔X)≡¬[(Y⇒X)∧(X⇒Y)]\n$$\n\nNow, we represent all the implications using disjunctions and negations:\n\n$$\n¬[(Y⇒X)∧(X⇒Y)]≡¬[(¬Y∨X)∧(¬X∨Y)]\n$$\n\nNext, we use De Morgan's laws:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}¬[(¬Y∨X)∧(¬X∨Y)] & ≡¬(¬Y∨X)∨¬(¬X∨Y) \\\\  & ≡(¬¬Y∧¬X)∨(¬¬X∧¬Y)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we simplify the double negations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(¬¬Y∧¬X)∨(¬¬X∧¬Y) & ≡(Y∧¬X)∨(X∧¬Y)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Correct",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-182523\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">9.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"182523\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"287\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAC\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c21D4\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2261\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⇔</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≡</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sun, Oct 11th @ 5:35 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:13</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
