 xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-5A\" x=\"8533\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"9256\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is only II.</p>\n\n            </div>           \n        </div>",
