=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.678ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 722.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-29-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-29-Title\">\\textrm T</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E29-MJMAIN-54\" d=\"M36 443Q37 448 46 558T55 671V677H666V671Q667 666 676 556T685 443V437H645V443Q645 445 642 478T631 544T610 593Q593 614 555 625Q534 630 478 630H451H443Q417 630 414 618Q413 616 413 339V63Q420 53 439 50T528 46H558V0H545L361 3Q186 1 177 0H164V46H194Q264 46 283 49T309 63V339V550Q309 620 304 625T271 630H244H224Q154 630 119 601Q101 585 93 554T81 486T76 443V437H36V443Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E29-MJMAIN-54\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></td>\n    <td align=\"center\"><span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.678ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 722.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-30-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-30-Title\">\\textrm T</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E30-MJMAIN-54\" d=\"M36 443Q37 448 46 558T55 671V677H666V671Q667 666 676 556T685 443V437H645V443Q645 445 642 478T631 544T610 593Q593 614 555 625Q534 630 478 630H451H443Q417 630 414 618Q413 616 413 339V63Q420 53 439 50T528 46H558V0H545L361 3Q186 1 177 0H164V46H194Q264 46 283 49T309 63V339V550Q309 620 304 625T271 630H244H224Q154 630 119 601Q101 585 93 554T81 486T76 443V437H36V443Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E30-MJMAIN-54\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>Biconditional statements are so important that we give them a special symbol.</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"7.198ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 3099.1 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-31-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-31-Title\">\nP\\Leftrightarrow Q\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E31-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E31-MJMAIN-21D4\" d=\"M308 524Q318 526 323 526Q340 526 340 514Q340 507 336 499Q326 476 314 454T292 417T274 391T260 374L255 368Q255 367 500 367Q744 367 744 368L739 374Q734 379 726 390T707 416T685 453T663 499Q658 511 658 515Q658 525 680 525Q687 524 690 523T695 519T701 507Q766 359 902 287Q921 276 939 269T961 259T966 250Q966 246 965 244T960 240T949 236T930 228T902 213Q763 137 701 -7Q697 -16 695 -19T690 -23T680 -25Q658 -25 658 -15Q658 -11 663 1Q673 24 685 46T707 83T725 109T739 126L744 132Q744 133 500 133Q255 133 255 132L260 126Q265 121 273 110T292 84T314 47T336 1Q341 -11 341 -15Q341 -25 319 -25Q312 -24 309 -23T304 -19T298 -7Q233 141 97 213Q83 221 70 227T51 235T41 239T35 243T34 250T35 256T40 261T51 265T70 273T97 287Q235 363 299 509Q305 522 308 524ZM792 319L783 327H216Q183 294 120 256L110 250L120 244Q173 212 207 181L216 173H783L792 181Q826 212 879 244L889 250L879 256Q826 288 792 319Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E31-MJMATHI-51\" d=\"M399 -80Q399 -47 400 -30T402 -11V-7L387 -11Q341 -22 303 -22Q208 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435Q740 255 592 107Q529 47 461 16L444 8V3Q444 2 449 -24T470 -66T516 -82Q551 -82 583 -60T625 -3Q631 11 638 11Q647 11 649 2Q649 -6 639 -34T611 -100T557 -165T481 -194Q399 -194 399 -87V-80ZM636 468Q636 523 621 564T580 625T530 655T477 665Q429 665 379 640Q277 591 215 464T153 216Q153 110 207 59Q231 38 236 38V46Q236 86 269 120T347 155Q372 155 390 144T417 114T429 82T435 55L448 64Q512 108 557 185T619 334T636 468ZM314 18Q362 18 404 39L403 49Q399 104 366 115Q354 117 347 117Q344 117 341 117T337 118Q317 118 296 98T274 52Q274 18 314 18Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E31-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E31-MJMAIN-21D4\" x=\"1029\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E31-MJMATHI-51\" x=\"2307\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>So, we now have the following logical equivalence:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"30.893ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 13301.2 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-32-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-32-Title\">\nP \\Leftrightarrow Q \\equiv (P \\Rightarrow Q) \\land (Q \\Rightarrow P)\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E32-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751