#E49-MJMATHI-50\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1029\" xlink:href=\"#E49-MJMAIN-21D4\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2307\" xlink:href=\"#E49-MJMATHI-51\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is true if <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-50-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 751.5 936.9\" width=\"1.745ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-50-Title\">P</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\" id=\"E50-MJMATHI-50\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E50-MJMATHI-50\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-51-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.509ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 791.5 1080.4\" width=\"1.838ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-51-Title\">Q</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M399 -80Q399 -47 400 -30T402 -11V-7L387 -11Q341 -22 303 -22Q208 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435Q740 255 592 107Q529 47 461 16L444 8V3Q444 2 449 -24T470 -66T516 -82Q551 -82 583 -60T625 -3Q631 11 638 11Q647 11 649 2Q649 -6 639 -34T611 -100T557 -165T481 -194Q399 -194 399 -87V-80ZM636 468Q636 523 621 564T580 625T530 655T477 665Q429 665 379 640Q277 591 215 464T153 216Q153 110 207 59Q231 38 236 38V46Q236 86 269 120T347 155Q372 155 390 144T417 114T429 82T435 55L448 64Q512 108 557 185T619 334T636 468ZM314 18Q362 18 404 39L403 49Q399 104 366 115Q354 117 347 117Q344 117 341 117T337 118Q317 118 296 98T274 52Q274 18 314 18Z\" id=\"E51-MJMATHI-51\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E51-MJMATHI-51\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> have the <em>same</em> truth value. Otherwise, it is false. We can express this as another logical equivalence:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-52-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"3.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.005ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -934.9 14023.9 1367.4\" width=\"32.572ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-52-Title\">\nP\\Leftrightarrow Q \\equiv \\big(P \\land Q\\big) \\lor \\big(\\neg P \\land \\neg Q\\big)\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\" id=\"E52-MJMATHI-50\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M308 524Q318 526 323 526Q340 526 340 514Q340 507 336 499Q326 476 314 454T292 417T274 391T260 374L255 368Q255 367 500 367Q744 367 744 368L739 374Q734 379 726 390T707 416T685 453T663 499Q658 511 658 515Q658 525 680 525Q687 524 690 523T695 519T701 507Q766 359 902 287Q921 276 939 269T961 259T966 250Q966 246 965 244T960 240T949 236T930 228T902 213Q763 137 701 -7Q697 -16 695 -19T690 -23T680 -25Q658 -25 658 -15Q658 -11 663 1Q673 24 685 46T707 83T725 109T739 126L744 132Q744 133 500 133Q255 133 255 132L260 126Q265 121 273 110T292 84T314 47T336 1Q341 -11 341 -15Q341 -25 319 -25Q312 -24 309 -23T304 -19T298 -7Q233 141 97 213Q83 221 70 227T51 235T41 239T35 243T34 250T35 256T40 261T51 265T70 273T97 287Q235 363 299 509Q305 522 308 524ZM792 319L783 327H216Q183 294 120 256L110 250L120 244Q173 212 207 181L216 173H783L792 181Q826 212 879 244L889 250L879 256Q826 288 792 319Z\" id=\"E52-MJMAIN-21D4\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M399 -80Q399 -47 400 -30T402 -11V-7L387 -11Q341 -22 303 -22Q208 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435Q740 255 592 107Q529 47 461 16L444 8V3Q444 2 449 -24T470 -66T516 -82Q551 -82 583 -60T625 -3Q631 11 638 11Q647 11 649 2Q649 -6 639 -34T611 -100T557 -165T481 -194Q399 -194 399 -87V-80ZM636 468Q636 523 621 564T580 625T530 655T477 665Q429 665 379 640Q277 591 215 464T153 216Q153 110 207 59Q231 38 236 38V46Q236 86 269 120T347 155Q372 155 390 144T417 114T429 82T435 55L448 64Q512 108 557 185T619 334T636 468ZM314 18Q362 18 404 39L403 49Q399 104 366 115Q354 117 347 117Q344 117 341 117T337 118Q317 118 296 98T274 52Q274 18 314 18Z\" id=\"E52-MJMATHI-51\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M56 444Q56 457 70 464H707Q722 456 722 444Q722 430 706 424H72Q56 429 56 444ZM56 237T56 250T70 270H707Q722 262 722 250T707 230H70Q56 237 56 250ZM56 56Q56 71 72 76H706Q722 70 722 56Q722 44 707 36H70Q56 43 56 56Z\" id=\"E52-MJMAIN-2261\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\" id=\"E52-MJMAIN-28\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M152 251Q152 646 388 850H416Q422 844 422 841Q422 837 403 816T357 753T302 649T255 482T236 250Q236 124 255 19T301 -147T356 -251T403 -315T422 -340Q422 -343 416 -349H388Q359 -325 332 -296T271 -213T212 -97T170 56T152 251Z\" id=\"E52-MJSZ1-28\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M318 591Q325 598 333 598Q344 598 348 591Q349 590 414 445T545 151T611 -4Q609 -22 591 -22Q588 -22 586 -21T581 -20T577 -17T575 -13T572 -9T570 -4L333 528L96 -4Q87 -20 80 -21Q78 -22 75 -22Q57 -22 55 -4Q55 2 120 150T251 444T318 591Z\" id=\"E52-MJMAIN-2227\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\" id=\"E52-MJMAIN-29\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M305 251Q305 -145 69 -349H56Q43 -349 39 -347T35 -338Q37 -333 60 -307T108 -239T160 -136T204 27T221 250T204 473T160 636T108 740T60 807T35 839Q35 850 50 850H56H69Q197 743 256 566Q305 425 305 251Z\" id=\"E52-MJSZ1-29\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M55 580Q56 587 61 592T75 598Q86 598 96 580L333 48L570 580Q579 596 586 597Q588 598 591 598Q609 598 611 580Q611 574 546 426T415 132T348 -15Q343 -22 333 -22T318 -15Q317 -14 252 131T121 425T55 580Z\" id=\"E52-MJMAIN-2228\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M56 323T56 336T70 356H596Q603 353 611 343V102Q598 89 591 89Q587 89 584 90T579 94T575 98T572 102L571 209V316H70Q56 323 56 336Z\" id=\"E52-MJMAIN-AC\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMATHI-50\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1029\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-21D4\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2307\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMATHI-51\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"3376\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-2261\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"4433\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJSZ1-28\" y=\"-1\"></use>\n<use x=\"4891\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMATHI-50\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"5865\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-2227\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"6755\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMATHI-51\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"7546\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJSZ1-29\" y=\"-1\"></use>\n<use x=\"8227\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-2228\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"9117\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJSZ1-28\" y=\"-1\"></use>\n<use x=\"9575\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-AC\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"10243\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMATHI-50\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"11216\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-2227\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"12106\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMAIN-AC\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"12773\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJMATHI-51\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"13565\" xlink:href=\"#E52-MJSZ1-29\" y=\"-1\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>There are many ways to say <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-53-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.509ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 3099.1 1080.4\" width=\"7.198ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-53-Title\">P\\Leftrightarrow Q</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\" id=\"E53-MJMATHI-50\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M308 524Q318 526 323 526Q340 526 340 514Q340 507 336 499Q326 476 314 454T292 417T274 391T260 374L255 368Q255 367 500 367Q744 367 744 368L739 374Q734 379 726 390T707 416T685 453T663 499Q658 511 658 515Q658 525 680 525Q687 524 690 523T695 519T701 507Q766 359 902 287Q921 276 939 269T961 259T966 250Q966 246 965 244T960 240T949 236T930 228T902 213Q763 137 701 -7Q697 -16 695 -19T690 -23T680 -25Q658 -25 658 -15Q658 -11 663 1Q673 24 685 46T707 83T725 109T739 126L744 132Q744 133 500 133Q255 133 255 132L260 126Q265 121 273 110T292 84T314 47T336 1Q341 -11 341 -15Q341 -25 319 -25Q312 -24 309 -23T304 -19T298 -7Q233 141 97 213Q83 221 70 227T51 235T41 239T35 243T34 250T35 256T40 261T51 265T70 273T97 287Q235 363 299 509Q305 522 308 524ZM792 319L783 327H216Q183 294 120 256L110 250L120 244Q173 212 207 181L216 173H783L792 181Q826 212 879 244L889 250L879 256Q826 288 792 319Z\" id=\"E53-MJMAIN-21D4\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M399 -80Q399 -47 400 -30T402 -11V-7L387 -11Q341 -22 303 -22Q208 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435Q740 255 592 107Q529 47 461 16L444 8V3Q444 2 449 -24T470 -66T516 -82Q551 -82 583 -60T625 -3Q631 11 638 11Q647 11 649 2Q649 -6 639 -34T611 -100T557 -165T481 -194Q399 -194 399 -87V-80ZM636 468Q636 523 621 564T580 625T530 655T477 665Q429 665 379 640Q277 591 215 464T153 216Q153 110 207 59Q231 38 236 38V46Q236 86 269 120T347 155Q372 155 390 144T417 114T429 82T435 55L448 64Q512 108 557 185T619 334T636 468ZM314 18Q362 18 404 39L403 49Q399 104 366 115Q354 117 347 117Q344 117 341 117T337 118Q317 118 296 98T274 52Q274 18 314 18Z\" id=\"E53-MJMATHI-51\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E53-MJMATHI-50\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1029\" xlink:href=\"#E53-MJMAIN-21D4\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2307\" xlink:href=\"#E53-MJMATHI-51\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> in words. Among the most common are the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><em><span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-54-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 751.5 936.9\" width=\"1.745ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-54-Title\">P</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\" id=\"E54-MJMATHI-50\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E54-MJMATHI-50\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is equivalent to <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-55-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.509ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 791.5 1080.4\" width=\"1.838ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-55-Title\">Q</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<pa