:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> Otherwise, it is false.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>In other words, <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 3066.1 936.9\" width=\"7.121ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">A \\Leftrightarrow B</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L449 46H469Q523 49 533 63L521 213H283L249 155Q208 86 208 74ZM516 260Q516 271 504 416T490 562L463 519Q447 492 400 412L310 260L413 259Q516 259 516 260Z\" id=\"E4-MJMATHI-41\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M308 524Q318 526 323 526Q340 526 340 514Q340 507 336 499Q326 476 314 454T292 417T274 391T260 374L255 368Q255 367 500 367Q744 367 744 368L739 374Q734 379 726 390T707 416T685 453T663 499Q658 511 658 515Q658 525 680 525Q687 524 690 523T695 519T701 507Q766 359 902 287Q921 276 939 269T961 259T966 250Q966 246 965 244T960 240T949 236T930 228T902 213Q763 137 701 -7Q697 -16 695 -19T690 -23T680 -25Q658 -25 658 -15Q658 -11 663 1Q673 24 685 46T707 83T725 109T739 126L744 132Q744 133 500 133Q255 133 255 132L260 126Q265 121 273 110T292 84T314 47T336 1Q341 -11 341 -15Q341 -25 319 -25Q312 -24 309 -23T304 -19T298 -7Q233 141 97 213Q83 221 70 227T51 235T41 239T35 243T34 250T35 256T40 261T51 265T70 273T97 287Q235 363 299 509Q305 522 308 524ZM792 319L783 327H216Q183 294 120 256L110 250L120 244Q173 212 207 181L216 173H783L792 181Q826 212 879 244L889 250L879 256Q826 288 792 319Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-21D4\" stroke-width=\"1\"><