>\n<use x=\"4767\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"5434\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2261\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"6491\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-AC\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"7158\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJSZ1-5B\" y=\"-1\"></use>\n<use x=\"7576\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-28\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"7965\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-AC\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"8633\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-59\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"9674\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-21D2\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"10952\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-5A\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"11676\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"12287\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2227\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"13177\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-28\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"13567\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-5A\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"14568\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-21D2\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"15846\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-AC\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"16514\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-59\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"17277\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"17667\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJSZ1-5D\" y=\"-1\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Now, we represent all the implications using disjunctions and negations:\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"3.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.005ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -934.9 24967.9 1367.4\" width=\"57.99ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n\\lnot \\big[(\\lnot Y \\Rightarrow Z) \\land (Z \\Rightarrow \\lnot Y)\\big]\n\\equiv \\lnot \\big[(\\lnot \\lnot Y \\lor Z) \\land (\\lnot Z \\lor \\lnot Y)\\big] \n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M56 323T56 336T70 356H596Q603 353 611 343V102Q598 89 591 89Q587 89 584 90T579 94T575 98T572 102L571 209V316H70Q56 323 56 336Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-AC\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M118 -250V750H255V710H158V-21